  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You’ve carefully developed your poison for greater versatility.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Poison Spitter, poison eater alraun, character level 7th.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can change your poison’s type (from injury to contact, ingested, or inhaled) by expending twice as many of your daily uses as normal. When used as an inhalation poison, your poison fills one adjacent 5-ft.-square for a number of rounds equal to half your hit dice, affecting the first creature to enter that square.</p>\n<p><strong>Normal:</strong> Alraun poison is an injury poison.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/racial-feats#toc4\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
